.TH "RPMDEPS" "1" "2026-03-06" "RPM 6.0.1"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
rpmdeps \- Generate RPM Package Dependencies
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrpmdeps\fR <operation> [options]
.PP
\fBrpmdeps\fR <operation> [options] \fIFILE\fR .\&.\&.\&
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\fBrpmdeps\fR generates package dependencies for one or more files, received
either as a list of filenames on the standard input, or command line
arguments.\&
.PP
\fBrpmdeps\fR is not normally invoked directly, but doing so can be useful for
troubleshooting dependency generation and developing new dependency generators.\&
The installation directory of \fBrpmdeps\fR can be determined with
\fBrpm -E "%{_rpmconfigdir}"\fR.\&
.PP
Note that the actual \fBrpmdeps\fR command is only used for automatic dependency
generation in a legacy compatibility mode of \fBrpmbuild\fR(1).\&
.PP
.SH OPERATIONS
\fB--alldeps\fR
.RS 4
Print all the dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--conflicts\fR
.RS 4
Print the conflicts dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--enhances\fR
.RS 4
Print the enhances dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--obsoletes\fR
.RS 4
Print the obsoletes dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--orderwithrequires\fR
.RS 4
Print the orderwithrequires dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-P, --provides\fR
.RS 4
Print the provides dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--recommends\fR
.RS 4
Print the recommends dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-R, --requires\fR
.RS 4
Print the requires dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--suggests\fR
.RS 4
Print the suggests dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--supplements\fR
.RS 4
Print the supplements dependencies.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
\fIFILE\fR
.RS 4
Any regular file.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
See \fBrpm-common\fR(8) for the options common to all operations.\&
.PP
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
\fBRPM_BUILD_ROOT\fR
.RS 4
The prefix path to strip out when generating dependencies
based on actual paths.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
On success, 0 is returned, a nonzero failure code otherwise.\&
.PP
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
\fBrpmdeps --requires /bin/ls\fR
.RS 4
Output the automatic requires dependencies of the \fBls\fR(1) binary.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBfind popt-1.\&19-build/BUILDROOT -type f | /usr/lib/rpm/rpmdeps -P\fR
.RS 4
Output the automatic provides of all files in the
\fIpopt-1.\&19-build/BUILDROOT\fR directory
.PP
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBrpm\fR(8), \fBrpmbuild\fR(1), \fBrpm-common\fR(8)
